    "rating": 4.3,
    "reference": "ChIJ82ql9xI4yUwRpehHkdkV5q8",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Arun Kataria",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102890631182057582622/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU7gzB4fZSRCMxZySWJqRaCh1s0LEOfaErb0_Yar82qnnTnV9my=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "The bad reviews are true. I walked in with a semi-decent credit looking at particular vehicle that was priced very well. Gave them a call to set up an appointment, but I asked the person for the Carfax, which he said “he doesn’t have.”\nBy good faith, I still went. Got served by a young sales person. First thing I asked for was the carfax, which he said “I can get that for you AFTER you answer these questions.”\nCar looked good on the exterior, but doesn’t mean the inside was. I answered his questions, and again, asked for the Carfax. This time he said “it takes us about 15-20 minutes to load it up.”\nAt that point, all the red alarms started ringing. They basically pressured me into the credit check, finance manager comes up to me with his games by saying “I wouldn’t apply elsewhere if I were you because it’ll damage your credit”\nI was then told by the finance director AFTER we did the credit inquiry that the car had $30k on the carfax…\n\nGo to a trustworthy dealership. Avoid these people like the plague for your own good.",
        "time": 1768694819,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Uniform Bravo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106754176977434126971/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUk9HqzDHush2JChEBh0rEMPFwVKwVwMsc0GmLrkTKbg6OyKGGm=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Employees are great but policies, prices and tactics are full blown scam tactics. Everytime I've walked in the store just for a bit of information I'm trapped in the store for hours on end. There's a ton of pressure to purchase the cars and they are very very vague on how the pricing works, but essentially you are going to be paying a lot more money than what you see listed regardless if you finance it or purchase the vehicle outright. On the website they have beautiful cars, somewhat competitive prices but they will not give you any information until you are physically in the store and it's only then you are made aware of how bad some of these vehicles really are.  For example one car was accidented 16k damages, was in multiple provinces, was used as a car rental etc and you would have never known just by looking at their availabile cars on the website but they do it to bait you into the store. They are not commissioned based but there's just as much pressure if not more from the sales manager. I feel they target people who can't really afford the cars they want  with low weekly payments because the know most people won't do the math to realize theyre spending sometimes double what the car is really worth. Gave it a shot, definitely would never buy from them.",
        "time": 1765896924,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Morgan Malnati",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115374819638332335273/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUgIjTEQO6ihSfAUfmsM8DqT9UTCzoZ7hT0I8EGj_WtZ4GDvXq0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Was a wonderful experience purchasing my first car with them. Daryk, Samuel, Gabrielle and Myriam made my experience quick, easy and smooth. Daryk was super transparent and did an excellent job at finding cars in my budget! I left feeling super satisfied with my purchase! They're friendliness and patience during the process was truly appreciated. Would highly recommend purchasing a car through Automobile en direct!",
        "time": 1760566733,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Ben G",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103962329708480756588/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJZIjPvsU5fgjJKEbdLDa4u9D2SyVt4uGOecxBY8c0Rf6jEJA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "We had a great experience with our recent purchase. The entire process was smooth and stress-free!",
        "time": 1764200631,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
